WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:02.340
Let's go to Scott from Trenton.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.789
Scott from Trenton.

00:00:03.789 --> 00:00:04.950
What is on your mind?

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.170
I. Good morning.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.170
Hear me?

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.170
Yes, I can hear you.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.170
Excellent.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.980
I just wanted to know.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:19.980
Coming from I am from Canada, and I'm just
wondering how you have 40 percent of the population

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.470
who actually supports Donald Trump.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:28.390
And what do you think that they're going to
do, say when?

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.829
By when?

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.160
So this is Trenton, Ontario.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.840
Is that what's going on?

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:33.840
Yes.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:34.840
OK.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:35.840
I couldn't see it.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.350
I assumed it was maybe New Jersey.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.350
It would be.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.350
Right.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.570
There's a Trenton in New Jersey, I think,
in any case.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:45.579
Listen, I understand your shock and amazement
that, you know, tens of millions of people

00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:47.690
in this country are voting for Donald Trump.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.820
I have raised this issue many times.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.670
If Biden wins and let's not assume.

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:53.640
But if Biden wins.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:59.559
What happens to those 60 million people in
the interim period between Election Day and

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:00.579
Inauguration Day?

00:01:00.579 --> 00:01:05.350
I believe there's a real possibility that
they become violent, including with firearms.

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.100
Beyond that.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.310
I don't know what happens.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:12.679
You know, they I think a lot of them are going
to pretend like they never really supported

00:01:12.679 --> 00:01:13.749
Trump.

00:01:13.749 --> 00:01:20.149
Some of them may split off into some kind
of Q and on conspiracy rabbit hole that maybe

00:01:20.149 --> 00:01:23.049
at some point will become a more formal political
movement.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.709
Is very, very difficult to say.

00:01:25.709 --> 00:01:29.270
But there are going to be here and we're going
to have to deal with it as a country.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:34.030
And I don't know exactly how we do that.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:39.279
I just I watch your show or listen to your
show all the time, and I'm just genuinely

00:01:39.279 --> 00:01:43.209
concerned that.

00:01:43.209 --> 00:01:50.649
The U.S. has withdrawn its role as being the
leader of the free world, and yet.

00:01:50.649 --> 00:01:51.829
What's what's going to like?

00:01:51.829 --> 00:01:55.959
I just don't know how it proceeds or progresses
from here.

00:01:55.959 --> 00:01:56.959
I don't know either.

00:01:56.959 --> 00:02:00.619
I'm so what I'm trying to do is to take it
step by step.

00:02:00.619 --> 00:02:01.619
Have I voted?

00:02:01.619 --> 00:02:02.619
Yes.

00:02:02.619 --> 00:02:03.619
OK.

00:02:03.619 --> 00:02:04.619
I did that.

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:05.909
Next, let's see what happens on Tuesday.

00:02:05.909 --> 00:02:09.090
And then we'll continue to make plans after
that.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:11.189
In a while.

00:02:11.189 --> 00:02:19.490
Big fan, thanks for taking my call.

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:55.200
Appreciate it.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:10.989
Great 

00:03:10.989 --> 00:03:31.129
to hear 
from you very, very much.

